@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Reservation System — Domain classes
top to bottom direction
hide circle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 4
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FAFAF9
skinparam classBorderColor #57534E
skinparam ArrowColor #57534E
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
skinparam noteBorderColor #A8A29E

' Source: backend/app/domain/entities/*.py
class User <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +name: str
  +email: str
  +password_hash: str
  +role: Role = CUSTOMER
  --
  +require_admin(): None
}

enum Role {
  CUSTOMER = "customer"
  ADMIN = "admin"
}

class Resource <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +name: str
  +description: str = ""
}

class Slot <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +resource_id: UUID
  +starts_at: datetime
  +ends_at: datetime
  +price_irr: int
  --
  +ensure_future(now: datetime): None
  +ensure_bookable(now: datetime): None
}

class Reservation <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +user_id: UUID
  +slot_id: UUID
  +amount_irr: int
  +status: ReservationStatus = PENDING
  +created_at: datetime
  +slot: Slot | None = None
  --
  +place(user_id: UUID, slot: Slot, now: datetime): Reservation <<classmethod>>
  +ensure_payable(now: datetime): None
  +cancel(): None
  +confirm(now: datetime): None
}

enum ReservationStatus {
  PENDING = "pending"
  CONFIRMED = "confirmed"
  CANCELLED = "cancelled"
}

class Payment <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +reservation_id: UUID
  +amount_irr: int
  +provider_reference: str
  +status: PaymentStatus = PENDING
  +created_at: datetime
  --
  +ensure_matches(reservation: Reservation): None
  +ensure_pending(): None
  +succeed(): None
}

enum PaymentStatus {
  PENDING = "pending"
  SUCCEEDED = "succeeded"
}

class Transaction <<dataclass>> {
  +id: UUID
  +payment_id: UUID
  +reference: str
  +amount_irr: int
  +created_at: datetime
}

User --> Role : role
Slot ..> Resource : resource_id (UUID)
Reservation ..> User : user_id (UUID)
Reservation --> "0..1" Slot : slot / slot_id
Reservation --> ReservationStatus : status
Payment ..> Reservation : reservation_id (UUID)\nensure_matches()
Payment --> PaymentStatus : status
Transaction ..> Payment : payment_id (UUID)

note right of Slot
  Construction validates timezone-aware times,
  ends_at > starts_at and positive price.
  Times are normalized to UTC.
end note

note right of Reservation
  place() snapshots slot.price_irr.
  pending -> confirmed | cancelled
  confirm() requires a pending, future booking.
  A confirmed booking needs a refund workflow.
end note

legend left
  All entities are dataclass(eq=False); IDs default to uuid4().
  created_at defaults to utcnow(); monetary values use integer IRR.
  Amount validation: 0 < amount <= 1,000,000,000,000.
  __post_init__ validation and generated dataclass methods are omitted.
  Dashed entity links identify UUID references, not stored object fields.
  Reservation.slot is optional in memory; its SQL mapping is viewonly.
  Database cardinalities and constraints are in database.puml.
endlegend
@enduml
